msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:1
msgid "环境变量与编译选项"
msgstr "Environment Variables and Compiler Options"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:3
msgid ""
"本文汇总 Triton-Ascend 中可由开发者显式控制的行为开关，包括运行前设置的环境变量，以及编译期通过 `triton.Config` 或 "
"kernel launch meta-parameter 传入的 NPU 编译选项。"
msgstr ""
"This document summarizes Triton-Ascend behavior controls that developerscan "
"set explicitly, including environment variables configured beforerunning a "
"program and NPU compiler options passed through`triton.Config` or kernel "
"launch meta-parameters."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:5
msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "Environment Variable"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:7
msgid "环境变量用法示例"
msgstr "Environment Variable Usage Example"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:9
msgid "环境变量需在运行 Python 程序前设置，例如："
msgstr ""
"Set environment variables before starting the Python program. Example:"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:16
msgid "环境变量参考表"
msgstr "Environment Variable Reference Table"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md:18
msgid "环境变量配置参考下表："
msgstr "The following table describes how to set environment variables."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default Value"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Function Description"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "配置说明"
msgstr "Setting Description"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "变更声明"
msgstr "Change Description"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "**调试与日志**"
msgstr "**Debug and Logging**"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_DEBUG"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0 或未设置"
msgstr "0 or not set"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"启用 Triton 的调试输出功能，用于在运行时打印详细的调试信息。这对于排查编译或执行阶段的问题非常有用。 当设置为 1 时，Triton "
"会输出更多关于编译过程、内核生成和执行的信息。 某些实现中可能支持更细粒度的调试级别（如 2, 3 等），具体取决于 Triton 的版本和实现。"
msgstr ""
"Enables Triton's debugging output for printing detailed debug information at"
" runtime, which is useful for troubleshooting compilation or execution "
"issues. When set to 1, Triton outputs more information about the compilation"
" process, kernel generation, and execution. Some implementations may support"
" finer-grained debug levels (such as 2, 3, etc.), depending on the Triton "
"version and implementation."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不启用DEBUG<br>1：启用DEBUG"
msgstr "0: Disable DEBUG<br>1: Enable DEBUG"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "在每次 MLIR 优化前转储所有内核的 IR。使用 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName`可以只转储特定内核的IR。"
msgstr ""
"Dumps the IR of all kernels before each MLIR optimization pass. Use "
"`MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName` to dump only the IR of a specific kernel."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储所有内核IR kernelName：转储特定内核IR"
msgstr ""
"0: Do not dump<br>1: Dump IR of all kernels<br>kernelName: Dump IR of a "
"specific kernel"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"Triton 缓存可能干扰转储。如果 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`  不生效，可尝试清理 Triton 缓存： `rm -r "
"~/.triton/cache`"
msgstr ""
"The Triton cache may interfere with the dump. If `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` does "
"not take effect, try clearing the Triton cache: `rm -r ~/.triton/cache`"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "在每次 LLVM IR 优化前转储 IR。"
msgstr "Dumps the IR before each LLVM IR optimization pass."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储IR"
msgstr "0: Do not dump<br>1: Dump IR"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"
msgstr "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "未设置"
msgstr "Not set"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"在每个 MLIR 编译阶段前生成 MLIR 复现文件。如果某阶段失败，`<reproducer_path>`  将保存失败前的 MLIR 状态。"
msgstr ""
"Generates an MLIR reproduction file before each MLIR compilation phase. If a"
" phase fails, `<reproducer_path>` saves the MLIR state before the failure."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "<reproducer_path>：保存路径"
msgstr "`<reproducer_path>`: save path"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_INTERPRET"
msgstr "TRITON_INTERPRET"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "使用 Triton 解释器而非 GPU 运行，支持在核函数代码中插入 Python 断点"
msgstr ""
"Uses the Triton interpreter instead of running on a GPU, allowing Python "
"breakpoints to be inserted in kernel function code."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不支持断点<br>1：支持断点"
msgstr "0: Breakpoints not supported<br>1: Breakpoints supported"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "向LLVM 传递`-debug`参数，输出大量调试信息。若信息过多，可使用`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY`限制输出范围。"
msgstr ""
"Passes the `-debug` parameter to LLVM, outputting extensive debugging "
"information. If the output is too verbose, use `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` to "
"limit the scope."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不传递<br>1：传递"
msgstr "0: Do not pass<br>1: Pass"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"另一种减少输出干扰的方法是：先设置 "
"`LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`运行程序，提取目标LLVM优化通道前的中间表示（IR），然后单独运行LLVM的`opt`工具，此时可通过命令行添加`-debug-"
"only=foo`参数来限定调试范围。"
msgstr ""
"Another way to reduce output interference is to set `LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` "
"first to run the program, extract the IR before the target LLVM optimization"
" pass, and then run the LLVM `opt` tool separately with the `-debug-"
"only=foo` parameter to limit the debug scope."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"功能等同于 LLVM 的`-debug-only`命令行选项。该参数可将 LLVM 调试输出限定到特定的优化通道或组件名称（这些名称通过 LLVM 和 "
"Triton 中的`#define "
"DEBUG_TYPE`宏定义），从而有效减少调试信息的冗余输出。用户可指定一个或多个逗号分隔的值，例如：`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-"
"remove-layout-conversions\"`或`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-"
"layout-conversions,regalloc\"`。"
msgstr ""
"Functions the same as LLVM's `-debug-only` command-line option. This "
"parameter limits LLVM debug output to specific optimization passes or "
"component names (defined by the `#define DEBUG_TYPE` macro in LLVM and "
"Triton), effectively reducing redundant debug output. Users can specify one "
"or more comma-separated values, for example: "
"`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions\"` or "
"`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions,regalloc\"`."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "逗号分隔值：通道或组件名称"
msgstr "Comma-separated values: pass or component name"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "USE_IR_LOC"
msgstr "USE_IR_LOC"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"控制是否在生成的中间表示（IR）中包含位置信息（如文件名、行号等）。这些信息对调试很有帮助，但可能会增加生成的IR的大小。设置为1，会重新解析中间表示(IR)，将位置信息映射为具有特定扩展名的IR文件行号（而非Python源文件行号）。这能建立从IR到LLVM"
" IR/PTX的直接映射关系。配合性能分析工具使用时，可实现对IR指令的细粒度性能剖析。"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether to include location information (such as file name, line "
"number, etc.) in the generated IR. This information is helpful for debugging"
" but may increase the size of the generated IR. When set to 1, the IR is re-"
"parsed to map location information to IR file line numbers (rather than "
"Python source file line numbers). This establishes a direct mapping from IR "
"to LLVM IR/PTX, enabling fine-grained performance analysis at the IR "
"instruction level when used with profiling tools."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不包含位置信息<br>1：包含位置信息"
msgstr "0: Do not include location info<br>1: Include location info"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"
msgstr "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "在自动调优完成后，输出每个内核的最佳配置及总耗时。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs the best configuration and total time consumption for each kernel "
"after autotuning is complete."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不输出<br>1：输出"
msgstr "0: Do not output<br>1: Output"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "启用MLIR 编译过程中的备注信息输出，包括以备注形式输出的性能警告。"
msgstr ""
"Enables remark output during MLIR compilation, including performance "
"warnings output as remarks."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不启用<br>1：启用"
msgstr "0: Disable<br>1: Enable"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核的转储功能，当启用时，Triton 会将生成的内核代码（各编译阶段IR及最终PTX）保存到指定目录。"
msgstr ""
"Enables or disables the Triton kernel dump function. When enabled, Triton "
"saves the generated kernel code (IR at each compilation stage and the final "
"PTX) to the specified directory."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "当前工作目录或未设置"
msgstr "Current working directory or not set"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "指定 Triton 内核转储文件的保存目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`时保存IR和PTX的目录。"
msgstr ""
"Specifies the directory for saving Triton kernel dump files. The directory "
"where IR and PTX are saved when `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "\"path\"：保存路径"
msgstr "\"path\": save path"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"
msgstr "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"当设置为`1` 或者 `true`时（`TRUE` 将被转换为 `true`），启用`tl.device_print`功能。 "
"重要说明：该功能使用GM缓冲区（其指针被传递给内核）。"
msgstr ""
"Enables the `tl.device_print` function when set to `1` or `true` (`TRUE` "
"will be converted to `true`). Important: This function uses the GM buffer "
"(its pointer is passed to the kernel)."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不启动<br>1：启用`tl.device_print`功能"
msgstr "0: Do not start<br>1: Enable `tl.device_print` function"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "每个线程的GM缓冲区最大为16KB，超限内容将被丢弃。该值目前固定，后续将通过环境变量调整。"
msgstr ""
"The GM buffer for each thread is at most 16 KB. Excess content will be "
"discarded. This value is currently fixed and will be adjustable via "
"environment variables in the future."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"
msgstr "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"控制是否生成内存使用情况的 json 文件。当`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`时保存 memory_info_aic/aiv.json"
" 文件到当前目录 。"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether to generate a JSON file of memory usage. When "
"`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`, saves the memory_info_aic/aiv.json file to the "
"current directory."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "**编译控制**"
msgstr "**Compilation Control**"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"控制 Triton 是否每次运行都强制重新编译内核，而不是使用已有的缓存版本。 默认情况下，Triton "
"会对已经编译过的内核进行缓存（基于参数和配置），以提高性能。 设置为 1 后，Triton "
"将忽略缓存并每次都重新编译内核，这在调试或测试新编译器特性时非常有用。"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether Triton forces recompilation of kernels on each run instead "
"of using cached versions. By default, Triton caches compiled kernels (based "
"on parameters and configurations) to improve performance. When set to 1, "
"Triton ignores the cache and recompiles kernels every time, which is useful "
"for debugging or testing new compiler features."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：不启用<br>1：每次运行都重新编译所有内核"
msgstr "0: Disable<br>1: Recompile all kernels on each run"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"
msgstr "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"当设置为 1 时，可以禁用 LLVM "
"编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化)。当设置为字符串，解析为要禁用的LLVM优化标志列表。例如使用`DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-"
"lsr\"`可禁用循环强度优化（该优化在某些存在寄存器压力的内核中可能导致高达10%的性能波动）。"
msgstr ""
"When set to 1, disables LLVM optimization steps during compilation "
"(make_llir and make_ptx LLVM optimizations). When set to a string, it is "
"parsed as a list of LLVM optimization flags to disable. For example, "
"`DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-lsr\"` disables loop strength reduction (which "
"can cause up to 10% performance fluctuation in kernels with register "
"pressure)."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"0：LLVM 的优化是启用状态<br>1：禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化) "
"<list>:\"disable-lsr\":禁用循环强度优化 </list>"
msgstr ""
"0: LLVM optimization is enabled<br>1: Disable LLVM optimization steps during"
" compilation (make_llir and make_ptx LLVM "
"optimizations)<br><list>:\"disable-lsr\": Disable loop strength "
"reduction</list>"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "启用或禁用 MLIR 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enables or disables timing statistics during MLIR compilation."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "启用或禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enables or disables timing statistics during LLVM compilation."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"
msgstr "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "1 启用"
msgstr "1 (enabled)"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "控制是否默认启用浮点运算融合优化，覆盖默认的浮点运算融合行为（如mul+add->fma）。"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether to enable floating-point operation fusion optimization by "
"default, overriding the default floating-point fusion behavior (such as "
"mul+add->fma)."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核覆盖功能，允许在每个编译阶段开始时用用户指定的外部文件（IR/PTX等）覆盖默认生成的内核代码。"
msgstr ""
"Enables or disables the Triton kernel override function, allowing user-"
"specified external files (IR/PTX, etc.) to override the default generated "
"kernel code at the beginning of each compilation stage."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "指定 Triton 内核覆盖文件的查找目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`时加载IR/PTX文件的目录。"
msgstr ""
"Specifies the directory for finding Triton kernel override files. The "
"directory from which IR/PTX files are loaded when "
"`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ASCEND_COMPILE_SPEED_OPT"
msgstr "TRITON_ASCEND_COMPILE_SPEED_OPT"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "控制JIT编译器在发现内核编译失败后是否跳过后续编译阶段。设为`1`跳过（默认`0`继续尝试）。"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether the JIT compiler skips subsequent compilation stages after "
"a kernel compilation failure. Set to `1` to skip (default `0` to continue "
"trying)."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：继续尝试<br>1：跳过"
msgstr "0: Continue trying<br>1: Skip"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "remote_launch时使用，只编译不运行。"
msgstr "Used for remote_launch: compile only, do not run."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_FFTS"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_FFTS"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "是否禁用FFTS。"
msgstr "Whether to disable FFTS."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：启用<br>1：禁用"
msgstr "0: Enable<br>1: Disable"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "是否禁用预编译。"
msgstr "Whether to disable precompilation."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "0：启用预编译<br>1：禁用预编译"
msgstr "0: Enable precompilation<br>1: Disable precompilation"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "**运行与调度**"
msgstr "**Runtime and Scheduling**"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL"
msgstr "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid ""
"启用或禁用自动根据物理核数优化逻辑核数，仅当逻辑核间可并行时方可启动。当逻辑核数大于物理核数时，启动该优化，则编译器自动调整逻辑核数量为物理核数，减少调度开销；启用后允许grid>65535。限制：triton"
" kernel的逻辑必须对执行顺序不敏感才能开启该选项，否则可能会导致死锁。"
msgstr ""
"Enables or disables automatic optimization of the logical core count based "
"on the physical core count. This can only be enabled when logical cores can "
"run in parallel. When the logical core count exceeds the physical core "
"count, enabling this optimization makes the compiler automatically adjust "
"the logical core count to the physical core count, reducing scheduling "
"overhead. When enabled, grid>65535 is allowed. Limitation: The Triton kernel"
" logic must be insensitive to execution order; otherwise, deadlocks may "
"occur."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "是否开启task_queue。"
msgstr "Whether to enable task_queue."

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER"

#: ../../zh/environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md
msgid "是否启用 SANITIZER。"
msgstr "Whether to enable SANITIZER."

